r":"Unknown","discs":"2","has_mp3":"0","shndiscs":"1","publisher":"Unknown","updater":"unix:etree","type":"sound","year":"1996","collection":["Dispatch","etree"],"title":"Dispatch Live at Middlebury College on 1996-04-16","backup_location":"ia903600_9"},"reviews":[{"review_id":"54489","reviewbody":"This is a great recording of dispatch, great sound, not to overwhelmed by audience, same recording of silent steeples as on GUT THE VAN, an amazing one at that, and some other tunes that were not released but still amazing, such as remake me, a song that the guys attempted to sing at their warm up show in Boston at the Somerville theater, before the hatch shell.  a great song that didn\u00c2t make the cut for any of the albums, but defiantly a great dispatch tune.\n\nFor the dispatch fan who loves the classics, this is the show for you, A great show of Dispatch's musical talent, one could consider this a live version of the album silent steeples.  \n\nKeep the music going suggest this show to friends, burn it give it out, \n\nPeace","reviewtitle":"Great show","reviewer":"beentown43","reviewdate":"2005-11-01 17:04:51","createdate":"2005-11-01 17:04:51","stars":"5"},{"review_id":"66013","reviewbody":"Great early Dispatch show... shows them in the beg. Sound quality couldn't be better... sounds like an album.  D/L this show people! It's a good early one.... \n\n~ Kayla","reviewtitle":"Good show...","reviewer":"sts9istrippy","reviewdate":"2006-04-05 19:34:34","createdate":"2006-04-05 19:34:34","stars":"5"},{"review_id":"66308","reviewbody":"I happen to think that the songs that are on here and on Silent Steeples are better on Silent Steeples, but this is still a great recording.  \n\nIt features some not known songs which are just fantastic, my favorite being either Remake Me or the song that goes \"this is the sign, this is the cross, this is where I get lost\".  As an earlier reviewer said, this sounds like an album; it's just that good. \n\n5 out of 5 stars, if I could give more I would.\n\n- Justin","reviewtitle":"Superb Show","reviewer":"Spatcher","reviewdate":"2006-04-10 14:18:11","createdate":"2006-04-10 14:18:11","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"help guys, i try to download certain songs, but it downloads them in .shn format, and i cannot open them via window media player or itunes. can someone tell me how to convert the song format, or help me in any way? i love dispatch and i want to download some of their live shows!","reviewtitle":"help me!","stars":"5","reviewer":"SpatchLover","createdate":"2006-08-08 21:45:01","reviewdate":"2006-08-08 21:45:01"},{"reviewbody":"This song is called \"Desert Sky\" and has only appeared like 3 times in concert.","reviewtitle":"Title of \"this is a sign this is a cross\" song","reviewer":"Dispatch318","reviewdate":"2007-08-15 18:55:16","createdate":"2007-08-15 18:55:16","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"What a great show. This is one of the reasons I love Dispatch so much, their craziness on the acoustic guitars. This is a showcase of Silent Steeples it seems like. This version of Steeples is the same as the one Gut The Van. There are some songs on this that are completely unreleased (remake me, desert sky) that are simply amazing. The sound quality is so good that they could have sold this as a CD and no one would know it was fan-recorded. Soundboard rules!\n\nDownload now, but a warning: You will be unable to listen to anything else for quite a few weeks, if not months.","reviewtitle":"My god...","reviewer":"Two2Coins2","reviewdate":"2008-02-05 14:32:09","createdate":"2008-02-05 14:32:09","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"how do you download? ive been listening off the site patchmusic its soo good, ive never heard some of this stuff (my favorite band i stalk them)","reviewtitle":"helpp","reviewer":"closertothesunn7","reviewdate":"2008-05-29 01:32:06","createdate":"2008-05-29 01:32:06","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"yes, how do you download.. im new at this","reviewtitle":"download","reviewer":"jlee77a","reviewdate":"2010-04-07 04:32:58","createdate":"2010-04-07 04:32:58","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"emai is mcboroshok@yahoo.com. thanks!","reviewtitle":"help me","reviewer":"mcboroshok","reviewdate":"2011-02-07 04:47:28","createdate":"2011-02-07 04:33:05","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"if someone could explain how to download this stuff, it would be greatly appreciated. thanks","reviewtitle":"download?","reviewer":"bzip23","reviewdate":"2011-05-14 23:55:42","createdate":"2011-05-14 23:55:42","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"You have to convert them to mp3","reviewtitle":"Convert","reviewer":"erics321","reviewdate":"2011-10-04 00:38:04","createdate":"2011-10-04 00:38:04","stars":"5"}],"server":"ia800700.us.archive.org","uniq":2118887170,"workable_servers":["ia800700.us.archive.org","ia600700.us.archive.org"]}